# NPClaude speech: the first writing pass.
#
# Each "== name ==" is a symbol; each line under it is one way to say it. [name] fills in another symbol, a fact
# or a word. Braces at the end hold conditions: a pole (polite, polite+ for strongly), a quirk (glutton), a fact
# (time=night), any of them negated with "!", and w=2 to make a line more likely. Lines with more conditions are
# picked more often when they fit, so every symbol keeps plain lines as a fallback.
#
# Facts: name, listener, listener_type (player/npc), opinion (enemy/disliked/neutral/friendly/friend/close_friend),
# leader (yes/no), time (morning/day/evening/night), weather (rain/clear), mood (awful/bad/okay/good/great),
# health (fine/hurt/low), recovering (yes/no), has_faction, has_enemy, address, catchphrase.
# Words: favorite_food, hated_food, faction, enemy_faction, and per event: enemy, food, item.
# Word modifiers: .a .the .s .it .is .this .cap

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Speech style pools: rolled once per NPC.

== style_address ==
friend
friend                       {polite}
traveler                     {proper}
stranger                     {introvert}
pal                          {lighthearted}
mate                         {crude}
bud                          {crude, lighthearted}
chief                        {lighthearted}
my friend                    {proper, polite}
kid                          {rude}
buddy                        {extrovert}

== style_catchphrase ==
Cube God willing.            {pious, w=3}
Cube God keep you.           {pious, w=2}
Mark my words.               {proud}
Just saying.
Don't quote me on that.      {liar}
Honest truth.                {honest}
Could be worse.              {pessimist}
Could be better, too.        {pessimist}
Onward!                      {optimist}
Chin up.                     {optimist}
Ha!                          {lighthearted}
Heh.                         {lighthearted}
Anyway.
Funny old world.
Such is life.                {serious}
No rest for the wicked.      {hardworking}
Let's not rush things.       {lazy}
Hm.                          {introvert}
Strange times.               {curious}
Watch your back.             {paranoid}
Easy does it.                {zen}

== style_filler ==
y'know                       {!proper}
I reckon                     {!proper+}
I suppose
eh                           {lighthearted}
mind you                     {proper}
honestly                     {!liar}
truth be told
see                          {crude}

