Hey, you.                    {rude}
Ugh, you.                    {rude+}
Morning.                     {time=morning}
Good morning!                {time=morning, optimist}
Evening.                     {time=evening}
You're up late.              {time=night}
...Hm.                       {introvert+}

== hello_named ==
[hello]
Hey, [listener].
[listener]!                  {extrovert}
