# Greetings: a player walks up.

== greet ==
[hello_named]
[hello_named] [smalltalk_short] {w=0.6}
[hello_named] Still in one piece, I see. {opinion=friend}
[listener]! There you are.   {opinion=close_friend, w=2}
Oh, it's you. Good.          {opinion=friend}
...                          {opinion=disliked}
Oh. It's you.                {opinion=disliked}
Keep walking.                {opinion=disliked, rude}
What do you want?            {opinion=disliked, rude+}
Hm. Hello.                   {opinion=disliked, polite}
Hey, [listener]. Coming along? {leader=yes}
Right behind you.            {leader=yes}
Mm.                          {taciturn, w=2}
[hello] Lovely weather for ducks. {weather=rain, lighthearted}
[hello] Miserable weather.   {weather=rain, pessimist}
[hello] Some rain, huh?      {weather=rain}
Oh, hey. Didn't see you there. {timid}
[hello] Need something?      {polite}
[hello] Make it quick.       {rude}
[hello] Make it quick, I'm working. {hardworking, rude}
Oh good, an excuse to stop working. {lazy, lighthearted}

== smalltalk_short ==
How's it going?
Keep safe out there.
Nice day.                    {weather=clear, time=day}
Rough day.                   {mood=bad}
What a day!                  {mood=great}

